.TH TESTIBC 1.SH NAMEtestibc \- IEEE-488 bus test program.SH SYNOPSIS\fBtestibc\fR.SH DESCRIPTIONA test program for a GESPAC IEEE-488 (GPIB) interface card, from Bruel &Kjaer, Denmark, 1989, written in Omegasoft Pascal.  It asks\fBTimeout time (1/10 Sec)?\fRand then offers its commands:\fBIfc\fR,\fR\fBRemote\fR,\fR\fBLlo\fR,\fR\fBGoto\fRlocal,\fBClear\fR,\fR\fBSend\fR,\fR\fBEnter\fR,\fR\fBDev-clear\fR,\fR\fBTime\fRand\fBQuit\fR.\fREvery one of them talks to the bus, so without the card it stops at thefirst.  Its messages come from\fB/dd/sys/errmsg.ibc\fR.\fR